# Concept Content Modules

- Each topic extends `BaseTopicModule` with `subtopics` using `ConceptGroup[]` bundles
- Register interactive diagrams in `module.ts` (implement `InteractiveDiagramProps`)
- Subtopic data in `subtopics/index.ts` — pure data, no JSX
- Diagrams in `diagrams/` — one interactive diagram per subtopic covering all groups
- Group `id` must match diagram focus keys for sync

Do not import UI into `subtopics/`. Use `$...$` for inline LaTeX in prose fields.
